00,000'\n+'Here is a big number: 200000000'\n/home/travis/build/yiisoft/yii2/tests/framework/i18n/FallbackMessageFormatterTest.php:151\n/home/travis/build/yiisoft/yii2/vendor/phpunit/phpunit/phpunit:36\n```\n\nIs it really needs to split thousands as with `intl`?\n\nI don't see that current implementation supports any number formatting, we are getting just plain number:\n[MessageFormatter.php:345](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/blob/master/framework/i18n/MessageFormatter.php#L345)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/10377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/10377/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":490040031,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50NDkwMDQwMDMx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/490040031","actor":{"login":"SilverFire","id":4499203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTkyMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4499203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire","html_url":"https://github.com/SilverFire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created